19:59:41 said  I have successfully reviewed the investigation and project status. The virtual tabletop (VTT) and Tabletop RPG platform (Roronoa / RRPG) has been completely built, tested, and verified using Rust with `egui` and `eframe`.
19:59:41 said  ### Summary of What Was Accomplished
