00:44:07 said  The **Rorphic RPG (Rorphic Roleplaying Game)** web frontend architecture has been successfully built, structured, configured, and verified under `app/web` (`C:\Users\João\Documents\Craft Anything\rrpg\app\web`).
00:44:07 said  ### Summary of Implementation & Verification
00:44:08 said  1. **Toolchain & Framework:** Built with React 18, Vite, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS for robust type safety, lightning-fast bundling, and responsive UI components.
00:44:08 said  2. **Dark Fantasy Aesthetic:** Styled with deep wine headers (`#58111A`, `#4A0E14`), radiant gold accents (`#D4AF37`), dark slate background surfaces, and custom CSS scrollbars.
00:44:08 said  3. **Interactive Tabletop Panels (`App.tsx`):**
00:44:08 said  - **Tactical Map Grid:** Interactive grid featuring token placement, coordinate tracking, and visual movement simulation.
00:44:08 said  - **Dice Roller Simulator:** Supports multi-die rolling (`d4`, `d6`, `d8`, `d10`, `d12`, `d20`, `d100`) with modifiable bonuses, critical successes, and roll history.
00:44:08 said  - **Participant & Character Sidebar:** Tracks party status, hit points (HP), armor class (AC), and initiative order.
00:44:08 said  - **Session Chat & Action Logs:** Real-time log panel recording combat events, roleplay actions, and dice roll outputs.
00:44:08 said  4. **Build Verification:** Production build (`tsc && vite build`) completed successfully with **zero errors**, generating optimized static bundles ready for deployment.
