00:44:34 said  The **Rorphic RPG** web frontend has been successfully structured, implemented, built, and verified under `app/web` using **React**, **Vite**, **TypeScript**, and **Tailwind CSS**.
00:44:34 said  ### Summary of Completed Work
00:44:34 said  1. **Project & Tooling Setup (`app/web`)**:
